    introDialogues:
    - Oh no, Boss! Poopzilla pooped on the city!
    - We are the only cleaning company in the city so there is a lot of work waiting.
    - But first, we need to clean our own store. Lets start with the walls!
    outroDialogues:
    - Great, it looks much better now! Here is the your rewrad!
