  - job: {fileID: 1697769014}
    speaker: {fileID: 1854972374}
    introDialogues:
    - Allright, now clean the crab statue on the roof and we are good to open the
      store again!
    outroDialogues:
    - Awesome! Let's get inside and grab our gear!
